    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Low back ache and morning stiffness; left thumb sore on gripping</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Slight numbness over the top of the left foot, fading; no weakness, saddle numbness, headache, dizziness or memory trouble</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No change in bladder control</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No heartburn, stomach pain or black stools on naproxen; bowels normal</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

